{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54821","headline":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 二十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，地上忽然（京本作「生」）黄。\n五谷或生幷地长（京本作「忽然生遍地」），将军禄位福无疆，士马乐（京本作「亦」）安康。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}